Skip the sleep inhibitor health check when inhibit_sleep is off.

With inhibit_sleep = false, Moonshine still tried to acquire a logind sleep
inhibitor during startup health checks, `moonshine healthcheck`, and the control
panel's Health page, warning about system D-Bus or the `moonshine` group.

Not upstream yet.

diff --git a/src/healthcheck.rs b/src/healthcheck.rs
index d6fa110..ab95409 100644
--- a/src/healthcheck.rs
+++ b/src/healthcheck.rs
@@ -282,7 +282,9 @@ pub fn run_healthcheck(config: Option<&Config>, gpu: &GpuContext) -> HealthRepor
 
 	check_xwayland(&mut report);
 	check_xdg_runtime(&mut report);
-	check_inhibit(&mut report);
+	if config.is_none_or(|config| config.inhibit_sleep) {
+		check_inhibit(&mut report);
+	}
 	check_kcmp(&mut report);
 
 	// --- Ports (requires config) ---
